---
# MISRA C++:2008 Advisory Rules Only
# Checks only rules with "advisory" obligation level

- description: MISRA C++ Advisory Rules (Recommended)
- qlpack: codeql/cpp-queries
- queries: .
  from: codeql/cpp-queries
- include:
    tags contain:
      - external/misra/obligation/advisory
- exclude:
    tags contain:
      - external/misra/obligation/required
